      <h2 id="olm-overriding-proxy-settings_olm-configuring-proxy-support" class="group scroll-mt-20">Overriding proxy settings of an Operator<a href="#olm-overriding-proxy-settings_olm-configuring-proxy-support" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h2>
      <p class="_abstract">If a cluster-wide egress proxy is configured, Operators running with Operator Lifecycle Manager (OLM) inherit the cluster-wide proxy settings on their deployments. Cluster administrators can also override these proxy settings by configuring the subscription of an Operator.</p>
      <Alert variant="info" class="my-4">
