      <CodeBlock code={"apiVersion: operators.coreos.com/v1alpha1\nkind: Subscription\nmetadata:\n  name: my-operator\nspec:\n  package: etcd\n  channel: alpha\n  config: (1)\n    selector:\n      matchLabels:\n        <labels_for_pods> (2)\n    volumes: (3)\n    - name: trusted-ca\n      configMap:\n        name: trusted-ca\n        items:\n          - key: ca-bundle.crt (4)\n            path: tls-ca-bundle.pem (5)\n    volumeMounts: (6)\n    - name: trusted-ca\n      mountPath: /etc/pki/ca-trust/extracted/pem\n      readOnly: true"} lang="yaml" />
      <ol>
      <li>Add a <code>config</code> section if it does not exist.</li>
      <li>Specify labels to match pods that are owned by the Operator.</li>
      <li>Create a <code>trusted-ca</code> volume.</li>
      <li><code>ca-bundle.crt</code> is required as the config map key.</li>
      <li><code>tls-ca-bundle.pem</code> is required as the config map path.</li>
      <li>Create a <code>trusted-ca</code> volume mount.</li>
